# Pine Script: TradingView Pine Script v5 language reference; requirements/languages/pinescript.md
name     pinescript pine
keyword  if else for to by while switch var varip import export method type and or not true false na
keyword  indicator library
type     int float bool color string line label table array matrix map series simple const
builtin  close open high low volume ta plot plotshape input strategy math request time
line-comment   //
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
operators  +-*/%=<>!?:.
calls
